OL,3,ADating app Bumble bought for $1.3bn
OL,4,
OL,5,FDating app Bumble has been taken over
OL,6,Fby a technology investment firm for
OL,7,F$1.3bn (#980m) with plans to "take it
OL,8,Finto the next era" of dating "in a
OL,9,Fworld transformed by AI".
OL,11,FIthaca Holdings is buying the business
OL,12,Fand its directors Ravi Gupta and John
OL,13,FHegeman will become co-chief executives
OL,14,Fof the dating app which was set up by
OL,15,FWhitney Wolfe Herd and differentiated
OL,16,Fitself by having a "women-first" chat
OL,17,Frule.
OL,19,FThe loss-making business ditched the
OL,20,Frule in August this year.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
