OL,4,
OL,5,FWolfe Herd, current chief executive of
OL,6,FBumble who co-founded dating app giant
OL,7,FTinder, said she would remain "actively
OL,8,Finvolved with Bumble".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
