OL,3,ARaye hits back at ticket touts who
OL,4,A'overwhelmed' sign-up for Albert Hall
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FRaye has hit back at ticket touts who
OL,8,Fshe says "overwhelmed" the sign-up
OL,9,Fprocess for an upcoming live show by
OL,10,Fusing artificial intelligence (AI) bots
OL,11,Fto create "hundreds of thousands of
OL,12,Ffake registrations".
OL,14,FThe Where Is My Husband! singer
OL,15,Frevealed there were 1.8 million
OL,16,Fsign-ups for her one-off 5,000-seat
OL,17,Fperformance at the Royal Albert Hall on
OL,18,F23 October.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
